    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>dP</mi><mi>dR</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>at</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>&nbsp;so power is maximum at&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>Therefore increase continuously till&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Ω</mi></math>&nbsp;and then decreases</p>",
